	quests: [
		{
			description: [
				"YUNG's Extras adds small, polished landmarks rather than giant empty dungeons. They appear only in newly generated chunks."
				"Use Explorer's Compass carefully and give ordinary travel a chance to reveal them naturally."
				"Lootr supports shared expeditions by giving each player individual contents in supported chests. Wait for teammates, do not break the container, and record landmarks that are worth revisiting with someone who missed the first trip."
				"Immersive Aircraft vehicles differ in speed, handling, fuel, cargo, and landing needs. Train over familiar ground, establish named landing fields, and avoid maximum-speed flight into terrain the server is still generating."
			]
			id: "7E8736C71C4B0718"
			rewards: [{
				id: "4A2148DD21CFA744"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 15
