			title: "New Landmarks to Discover"
			x: 0.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			description: [
				"Selected dungeon and treasure tables now receive one restrained bonus roll. Lootr makes the result individual per player."
				"There is still a large empty chance; exploration should feel exciting, not like a creative-mode dispenser."
				"Lootr supports shared expeditions by giving each player individual contents in supported chests. Wait for teammates, do not break the container, and record landmarks that are worth revisiting with someone who missed the first trip."
				"A creative expedition should return with more than screenshots: develop an album, label an object, write the route, and explain one mechanic. Art becomes field knowledge when it helps the next player understand the place."
			]
			id: "5EDA79A95A7A77B9"
