			description: [
				"Choose themes for displays: local wildlife, archaeological periods, biome materials, meals, relics or engineering milestones. A labelled collection teaches; an unsorted chest merely stores."
				"Leave duplicates for crafting and other players. Rare objects should not disappear into one private backpack when they could inspire a public exhibit."
				"Design museums with expansion space. The most interesting collection is never truly finished."
